WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
What if our universe

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.091
comes with a self-destruct button

00:00:04.091 --> 00:00:05.094
to eliminate itself

00:00:05.094 --> 00:00:06.492
so cleanly and efficiently,

00:00:06.492 --> 00:00:08.344
that every single physical thing

00:00:08.344 --> 00:00:09.799
would just stop existing

00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:11.632
and life would be impossible

00:00:11.632 --> 00:00:13.671
forever.

00:00:13.671 --> 00:00:16.444
The ultimate ecological catastrophe -

00:00:16.444 --> 00:00:17.944
vacuum decay.

00:00:17.944 --> 00:00:27.363
(Theme music)

00:00:27.363 --> 00:00:28.775
To explain how our universe

00:00:28.775 --> 00:00:29.842
could destroy itself,

00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:32.074
we need to understand two principles:

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:36.302
One - energy levels.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.403
A core idea in physics is that

00:00:38.403 --> 00:00:40.234
everything has an energy level.

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:43.324
The higher the level,
the more energy is in the system

00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:45.132
Wood, for example, has a high level.

00:00:45.132 --> 00:00:46.814
It can be burnt, a process that

00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:49.675
releases the chemical energy 
stored in its molecular bonds

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:51.564
and turns it into heat.

00:00:51.564 --> 00:00:53.385
The ash leftover is at a

00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:56.704
lower energy level than the wood before.

00:00:56.704 --> 00:00:58.934
Two - stability.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:01.804
Everything in our universe tries to move

00:01:01.804 --> 00:01:04.815
towards its ground state,
in which it's completely stable

00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:07.193
and has as little energy as possible.

00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:10.334
For example, a ball on a hill is unstable

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:12.691
and has a lot of potential energy.

00:01:12.691 --> 00:01:14.976
When disturbed,
it will roll down into the valey

00:01:14.976 --> 00:01:17.743
and lose its potential energy
in the process

00:01:17.746 --> 00:01:20.572
The ball is now
in its ground state and stable.

00:01:20.572 --> 00:01:22.445
It will remain like that.

00:01:22.445 --> 00:01:24.253
Everything in our universe

00:01:24.253 --> 00:01:25.913
follows these two principles.

00:01:25.913 --> 00:01:28.023
If something has a lot of energy,

00:01:28.023 --> 00:01:30.197
it's unstable and wants to get rid of it

00:01:30.197 --> 00:01:30.962
to become stable

00:01:30.962 --> 00:01:33.873
and reach its ground state.

00:01:33.873 --> 00:01:35.468
This is true for every system

00:01:35.468 --> 00:01:36.986
even in the weird world of

00:01:36.986 --> 00:01:39.334
quantum mechanics.

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:42.626
If our current understanding of physics
is correct, then the universe

00:01:42.646 --> 00:01:44.845
gets its properties from quantum fields.

00:01:44.845 --> 00:01:46.466
We explained them in detail

00:01:46.466 --> 00:01:47.918
in another video.

00:01:47.918 --> 00:01:49.224
For this video, imagine them

00:01:49.224 --> 00:01:50.906
as the rules of the universe.

00:01:50.906 --> 00:01:52.367
They tell particles how to

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:55.274
behave and interact

00:01:55.274 --> 00:01:56.793
Like everything in the universe,

00:01:56.793 --> 00:01:59.145
they want to be
in the lowest energy level possible,

00:01:59.145 --> 00:02:01.508
which is called a vacuum state.

00:02:01.508 --> 00:02:03.179
This has nothing to do with

00:02:03.179 --> 00:02:04.456
vacuum in space.

00:02:04.456 --> 00:02:05.798
It's just called this way

00:02:05.798 --> 00:02:10.126
because scientists are bad at
naming things

00:02:10.126 --> 00:02:11.965
We then call the fields reached their

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:14.626
vacuum state, except maybe one.

00:02:14.626 --> 00:02:17.297
It's possible that the Higgs Field

00:02:17.297 --> 00:02:20.144
is not stable, but metastable, which is

00:02:20.144 --> 00:02:21.736
a fancy way of saying that it

00:02:21.736 --> 00:02:24.757
pretends to be stable but really is not.

00:02:24.757 --> 00:02:26.628
It would be a false vacuum.

00:02:26.628 --> 00:02:29.107
The Higgs Field is responsible for

00:02:29.107 --> 00:02:30.678
giving particles their mass,

00:02:30.678 --> 00:02:32.407
which rules how almost everything

00:02:32.407 --> 00:02:34.308
in the universe interacts.

00:02:34.308 --> 00:02:37.559
What would happen if the Higgs Field
is a false vacuum?

00:02:37.559 --> 00:02:39.443
Think of our ball in the valley:

00:02:39.443 --> 00:02:42.325
the ball is the Higgs Field.

00:02:42.325 --> 00:02:45.816
The valley might not be the
lowest energy state for the Higgs Field.

00:02:45.816 --> 00:02:48.787
There might an even deeper valley
that it wants to get to.

00:02:48.787 --> 00:02:51.398
This would mean that the Higgs Field
has a lot of potential energy,

00:02:51.398 --> 00:02:53.207
waiting to be released.

00:02:53.207 --> 00:02:55.925
The Higgs Field could be
like a piece of wood

00:02:55.925 --> 00:02:57.378
but drenched in gasoline,

00:02:57.378 --> 00:03:00.077
waiting to set the universe on fire.

00:03:00.077 --> 00:03:01.780
A random spark like quantum tunneling

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.806
could release the potential energy

00:03:03.806 --> 00:03:05.247
of the Higgs Fields.

00:03:05.247 --> 00:03:06.788
This could happen at any time

00:03:06.788 --> 00:03:08.288
and without warning.

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:09.907
If at any point in space,

00:03:09.907 --> 00:03:12.007
this so-called vacuum decay starts,

00:03:12.007 --> 00:03:14.075
there is no turning back.

00:03:14.075 --> 00:03:15.959
As the Higgs Field crashes into

00:03:15.959 --> 00:03:17.319
the lower energy state,

00:03:17.319 --> 00:03:19.146
it releases a massive amount of

00:03:19.146 --> 00:03:20.620
potential energy.

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:22.328
This energy pushes the space around it

00:03:22.328 --> 00:03:23.727
over the barrier, which releases

00:03:23.727 --> 00:03:25.677
more potential energy.

00:03:25.677 --> 00:03:27.851
A sphere of the new stable Higgs Field,

00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:29.509
or true vacuum, grows at the

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:31.497
speed of light in all directions.

00:03:31.497 --> 00:03:35.101
Imagine it like setting a sea of gasoline,

00:03:35.101 --> 00:03:37.637
the size of the universe, on fire.

00:03:37.637 --> 00:03:39.268
This sphere is surrounded by

00:03:39.268 --> 00:03:41.218
a shell of energy that devours everything

00:03:41.218 --> 00:03:42.780
it comes into contact with.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.839
Whatever it touches

00:03:44.839 --> 00:03:46.991
is eliminated for existence.

00:03:46.991 --> 00:03:49.398
The bubble will continue to grow forever.

00:03:49.398 --> 00:03:51.437
deleting the universe on its way.

00:03:51.437 --> 00:03:53.420
There is no way to be warned,

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.309
since it's so fast.

00:03:55.309 --> 00:03:57.279
But there's nothing we can do anyway.

00:03:57.279 --> 00:03:59.369
Our destruction would be instant,

00:03:59.369 --> 00:04:00.949
in a fraction of second,

00:04:00.949 --> 00:04:03.219
Earth would be gone.

00:04:03.219 --> 00:04:04.960
But it actually gets worse.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.687
If the energy level

00:04:07.687 --> 00:04:09.037
of the Higgs Field changes,

00:04:09.037 --> 00:04:10.582
it changes all of physics.

00:04:10.582 --> 00:04:12.759
In the true vacuum of the sphere,

00:04:12.759 --> 00:04:14.717
the standard model will be overthrown,

00:04:14.717 --> 00:04:16.630
superseded by different physics

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.140
that we don't know -

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:20.689
how fundamental particles behave,

00:04:20.689 --> 00:04:22.338
how atoms hold together,

00:04:22.338 --> 00:04:24.612
how chemicals react.

00:04:24.612 --> 00:04:27.351
Vacuum decay won't just destroy life,

00:04:27.351 --> 00:04:29.422
it will destroy chemistry itself,

00:04:29.422 --> 00:04:31.950
making life as we know it impossible.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.851
We simply have no idea

00:04:33.851 --> 00:04:35.539
what it would be like inside.

00:04:35.539 --> 00:04:37.200
It might be a shadow of what it is now,

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.893
or not.

00:04:38.893 --> 00:04:40.271
We don't know.

00:04:40.271 --> 00:04:42.079
If vacuum decay happens,

00:04:42.079 --> 00:04:44.692
the outlook is indeed grim.

00:04:44.692 --> 00:04:46.320
If you feel slightly worried now,

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.201
don't be.

00:04:47.201 --> 00:04:49.029
At this point, false vacuum is speculation

00:04:49.029 --> 00:04:50.419
based on our current understanding of

00:04:50.419 --> 00:04:53.012
particle physics, which might be wrong.

00:04:53.012 --> 00:04:55.058
It's kind of like using a ruler

00:04:55.058 --> 00:04:56.549
to measure a continent.

00:04:56.549 --> 00:04:58.712
(playful music)

00:04:58.712 --> 00:05:01.009
Sure, you can do it, but you might be off

00:05:01.009 --> 00:05:02.511
by quite a bit at the end.

00:05:02.511 --> 00:05:05.770
Right now, no-one can say a vacuum decay

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.001
is a thing that's real

00:05:07.001 --> 00:05:08.944
or just a scary idea.

00:05:08.944 --> 00:05:11.501
But even if one or multiple spheres

00:05:11.501 --> 00:05:13.311
of death have already started expanding,

00:05:13.311 --> 00:05:14.559
the universe is so big

00:05:14.559 --> 00:05:16.203
that they might not reach us

00:05:16.203 --> 00:05:17.788
for billions of years.

00:05:17.788 --> 00:05:19.114
If they're far enough away,

00:05:19.114 --> 00:05:20.693
they might not ever be able to reach us

00:05:20.693 --> 00:05:23.052
because of the expansion of the universe.

00:05:23.052 --> 00:05:25.090
The speed of light is not that fast

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.610
on the scale of the universe.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.161
So, while vacuum decay is

00:05:29.161 --> 00:05:30.260
fascinatingly scary,

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.720
right now, there are other things

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.664
we should be more afraid of.

00:05:33.664 --> 00:05:35.615
In contrast to vacuum decay,

00:05:35.615 --> 00:05:37.230
we have the power to prepare

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:40.780
for most of them.

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.354
Videos like this one

00:05:42.354 --> 00:05:44.081
take hundreds of hours to make, so

00:05:44.081 --> 00:05:45.432
support us on Patreon

00:05:45.432 --> 00:05:46.685
if you'd like to learn more about

00:05:46.685 --> 00:05:48.282
the destruction of everything.

00:05:48.282 --> 00:05:49.794
It really helps us out.

00:05:49.794 --> 00:05:51.712
We tried to destroy the universe

00:05:51.712 --> 00:05:53.262
at least once every few months.

00:05:53.262 --> 00:05:54.521
So let us know in the comments,

00:05:54.521 --> 00:05:56.261
if you have doomsday scenarios

00:05:56.261 --> 00:05:58.184
you would like us to cover.

00:05:58.184 --> 00:05:59.000
